<title>SINGAPORE: India tenders to sell July 24-26 NGL from Hazira.</title>
<headline>India tenders to sell July 24-26 NGL from Hazira.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has on Wednesday issued a tender to sell 25,000 tonnes of natural gas liquids (NGL) lifting July 24-26 from Hazira on the west coast, industry sources said.</p>
<p>The tender closes July 17 and is valid for one day.</p>
<p>IOC's last NGL tender, for a cargo lifting July 12-14 from Hazira, was awarded to a Dutch trader at $37.00 per tonne below Japanese spot quotes on a free-on-board basis.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-8703086)</p>
